example:
支付库先提交，消费方再各写各的库。签收只改订单：

```java
@Transactional
public void markPaid(String paymentId, String orderId) {
  payment.markPaid(paymentId);
  outbox.insert(paymentId, "PaymentPaid", orderId);
}
```

```java
@Transactional
public void onPaid(String paymentId, String orderId) {
  orders.markPaidIfPending(orderId, paymentId);
}

@Transactional
public void confirm(String orderId) {
  stock.confirmIfReserved(orderId);
}

@Transactional
public void onShipped(String shipmentId, String orderId) {
  orders.markShippedIfPaid(orderId, shipmentId);
}

@Transactional
public void onReceived(String orderId) {
  orders.markCompletedIfShipped(orderId);
}
```

```sql
UPDATE orders SET status = 'PAID'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'PENDING';
UPDATE orders SET status = 'SHIPPED'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'PAID';
UPDATE orders SET status = 'COMPLETED'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'SHIPPED';
```

`markPaid` 不调用订单服务和锁定服务。`onReceived` 不写支付库，也不写锁定库。
